# __NAME__

A small Python project with a pytest test suite.

Layout:

    app.py            the code
    tests/test_app.py the tests
    pyproject.toml    project metadata and pytest options

Run the tests (pytest must already be installed — adOmnia never installs
packages for you):

    python -m pytest

Run the script:

    python app.py

Code Studio detects the project, proposes the run configurations and lists
the tests in the Test panel with the interpreter you select for the project.
